{
  "name": "CE-03 | Manual Clip Pickup",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CE-03 | Manual Clip Pickup\n**Why it exists:** the third option in the video chain. When Omni and Veo fail (or a row has `video_provider = manual_drop`) CE-02 emails you the scene prompts. You generate the clips in **Google Flow** with your Plus plan and drop them in a Drive folder.\n\n**Trigger:** every 10 minutes.\n\n**Flow**\n1. Finds the first row with `status = Awaiting Manual Clips`.\n2. Searches the *manual clips* Drive folder (`manualFolderId`) for files named `<id>_s1.mp4`, `<id>_s2.mp4` ...\n3. Downloads each one into `workDir/<id>/scene_N.mp4`.\n4. Checks whether **every** scene now exists on disk. If yes -> status `Clips Ready`. If not, it simply waits for the next upload.\n\n**Tips:** the file name must contain the row `id` followed by `_s` and the scene number. Clips need an audio track. Nothing happens (and nothing is billed) if the folder is empty.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ca1d7ab4-8ab4-58c4-ab33-127969576f38",
      "name": "Note - How this works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      },
